{"_meta":{"anthropic/maxResultSizeChars":100000},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Get a Technical Library page"},"description":"Retrieve one Technical Library page by slug, element name or canonical URL: general technical guidance on how a building element or functional space is built, its service life, how it fails, what to look for, how to tell causes apart, how serious a finding is (graded safety, failure, condition, lifecycle, deadline, check or nil), investigation, remedies, the shape of the cost (never a price), standards in Australia, the UK and the US, measured thresholds by market, and what to ask the owner or agent for. Each threshold applies only in its own market: pass market (AU, UK or US) for the building in question to get that market's values alone; section thresholds returns the values on their own. By default a summary with every section's anchored URL; section returns one section, format full the whole page (a part at a time on a long page, with nextCursor). Always includes a ready citation. It describes how elements behave in general, never the condition of a particular building; carry its limitations through.","icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","sizes":["32x32"],"src":"https://mcp.moyneross.com/moyneross-icon-32.png"},{"mimeType":"image/png","sizes":["256x256"],"src":"https://mcp.moyneross.com/moyneross-icon-256.png"},{"mimeType":"image/png","sizes":["512x512"],"src":"https://mcp.moyneross.com/moyneross-icon-512.png"}],"inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"cursor":{"description":"With format full on a long page: the nextCursor from the previous part.","maxLength":120,"type":"string"},"format":{"default":"summary","description":"summary (default): the question, short answer, where it applies, limitations, sources and the anchored sections. full: adds the complete text, a part at a time on a long page.","enum":["summary","f